<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<section class="docs">
  <h1>📖 Setup Guide</h1>
  <p class="sub">Activate the scraper with your subscription license key</p>

  <div class="doc-section">
    <h2>🔑 1. Get Your License Key</h2>
    <p>After subscribing, your license key appears on the <a href="/dashboard">dashboard</a>.</p>
    <p>Format: <code>SCRPR-XXXXXXXX-XXXXXXXX-XXXXXXXX</code></p>
  </div>

  <div class="doc-section">
    <h2>🐍 2. Set Your License Key</h2>
    <p>The scraper reads your license from the <code>SCRAPER_LICENSE_KEY</code> environment variable:</p>
    <pre><code>export SCRAPER_LICENSE_KEY="SCRPR-XXXXXXXX-XXXXXXXX-XXXXXXXX"
python3 main.py</code></pre>
    <p>On each startup, the scraper validates your license against our server. Subscribers get daily scrapes with expert data.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="doc-section">
    <h2>📋 3. What You Get</h2>
    <p>One plan. Full access. All features included:</p>
    <table class="doc-table">
      <tr><th>Feature</th><th>Trial</th><th>Subscriber</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Scrape Days</td><td>Monday only</td><td>Daily</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Data Level</td><td>Standard</td><td>Expert</td></tr>
      <tr><td>CSV Export</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>JSON Export</td><td>✕</td><td>✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Value Scoring</td><td>✕</td><td>✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Filtered Export</td><td>✕</td><td>✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Full-Text Search</td><td>✕</td><td>✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Raw Data Access</td><td>✕</td><td>✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Custom Fields</td><td>✕</td><td>✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Priority Support</td><td>✕</td><td>✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Auto-Registration</td><td>✕</td><td>✓</td></tr>
    </table>
    <p style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.85rem"><strong>Free first month</strong> on the monthly plan. Cancel anytime.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="doc-section">
    <h2>⚙️ 4. Running the Scraper</h2>

    <h3>Interactive Mode (with dashboard)</h3>
    <pre><code>cd /path/to/golf
export SCRAPER_LICENSE_KEY="SCRPR-XXXXXXXX-XXXXXXXX-XXXXXXXX"
python3 main.py</code></pre>
    <p>Starts a web dashboard at <code>http://localhost:8000</code> and runs the scrape on-schedule.</p>

    <h3>Headless Mode (CSV to stdout)</h3>
    <pre><code>cd /path/to/golf
export SCRAPER_LICENSE_KEY="SCRPR-XXXXXXXX-XXXXXXXX-XXXXXXXX"
python3 run_scraper.py > data.csv</code></pre>

    <h3>Cron (Linux/macOS)</h3>
    <pre><code># Run scraper daily — it will skip non-scheduled days automatically
0 6 * * * cd /path/to/golf && SCRAPER_LICENSE_KEY="YOUR_KEY" python3 run_fast.py</code></pre>
  </div>

  <div class="doc-section">
    <h2>🔄 5. Webhook Configuration</h2>
    <p>To receive subscription events, configure a Stripe webhook endpoint:</p>
    <pre><code>POST https://your-app.com/payments/webhook</code></pre>
    <p>Listen for these events:</p>
    <ul style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.8">
      <li><code>checkout.session.completed</code> — new subscription</li>
      <li><code>invoice.paid</code> — renew license for another month</li>
      <li><code>customer.subscription.updated</code> — plan changes</li>
      <li><code>customer.subscription.deleted</code> — cancellation</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="doc-section">
    <h2>❓ 6. Troubleshooting</h2>
    <table class="doc-table">
      <tr><td><strong>License server unreachable</strong></td><td>The scraper falls back to cached license data (valid for 1 hour) or free trial mode. Set <code>LICENSE_SERVER_URL</code> env var if your server isn't at localhost.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Scraper skips when I want it to run</strong></td><td>Subscribers get daily scrapes. If you're on the free trial, scrapes run on Monday only.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>How do I manage billing?</strong></td><td>Go to your Dashboard → Manage Billing. Stripe handles plan changes and cancellations.</td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

